### GET
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Get guidance for a HEALTH_ABNORMAL alert — has guidances
GET http://localhost:3000/api/alerts/2/guidance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer FLEET_MANAGER_TOKEN

########

### Get guidance — driver owns the alert
GET http://localhost:3000/api/alerts/2/guidance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_TOKEN

########

### Get guidance — driver does NOT own the alert (should 403)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/alerts/5/guidance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_TOKEN

########

### Get guidance for SOS alert — no health event (should 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/alerts/1/guidance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer FLEET_MANAGER_TOKEN

########

### Get guidance — alert not found (should 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/alerts/9999/guidance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN



